  Lemma holds on all 12 tight points of {1..12}: True
  [PROVED: ||a_j p/q||=s/q=1/13 => q=13s => 13|q; min dist = q/13 => residues in [q/13,12q/13].]
  [At q=13: residues are nonzero; completeness is a separate global pinning theorem.]
  [The displayed AP control has the complete nonzero residue system.]

