(C) The Goddyn-Wong mechanism fails at n=12
==========================================================================
  n=13 sporadic tight: {1..11,13,24} (M=1/14) -- large killer 24 kills sub-witnesses.
  n=12 analogs (drop one small elt, add a large multiple-of-12/13 killer):
    {1..11}+24       M=2/25     (0.0800)
    {1..11}+36       M=3/37     (0.0811)
